<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Best Buy, Circuit City.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Best Buy, Circuit City.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Best Buy Co Inc to market perform from underperform.</p>
<p>-- said it raised Circuit City Stores Inc-Circuit City Group to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Best Buy gained 3/4 to 11-1/4 and Circuit City gained 1-5/8 to 38.</p>
</text>
